## Notes

- `network_cidr` is required because VirtualBox uses it to derive the netmask for
  the host-only adapter.
- When `dhcp_lower_ip` and `dhcp_upper_ip` are omitted, they default to the first
  and last usable addresses of `network_cidr`.
- Changing `name` replaces the network.

